body: "Release ages verified on 2026-11-02 via the GitHub releases API: codeql-action v4.39.1 2026-10-21T15:48Z, CodSpeedHQ/action v5.6.0 2026-10-22T13:18Z, trufflehog v3.99.7 2026-10-24T06:04Z. Each proposed SHA equals the commit its tag dereferences to. Dependabot's own branch cannot pass because tests/integration/ci-workflow-contract.spec.ts pins the exact CodSpeed and TruffleHog SHAs and the TruffleHog version input, so the refresh lands with the contract update in a maintainer PR, as for pm-8skz5z."
